28:55.400 --> 28:56.510
Tak nak cerita lagi.

28:56.510 --> 28:58.110
Alam Kegersangan Berkabus.

28:59.480 --> 29:00.000
Tak nak cerita lagi.

29:00.000 --> 29:01.310
Ceritakan Alam Kegersangan Berkabus.

29:01.310 --> 29:02.000
Ya.

29:04.400 --> 29:05.930
Alam Kegersangan Berkabus

29:06.440 --> 29:08.570
