38:29.000 --> 38:29.530
Namun...

38:41.000 --> 38:42.530
Awak nak balik ke masa bila?

41:44.480 --> 41:45.010
Xiao Yao.

41:45.510 --> 41:46.360
Saya dah sediakan sesuatu...

41:46.360 --> 41:46.920
Maaf,

41:47.190 --> 41:48.720
